Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Condition on past observations (o_{t-K} ... o_t)

data.train.num_history_frames (K, default 0: the original model) and
data.train.history_stride add K past frames as clean conditioning latents.
Missing past frames near an episode start are hidden from attention
(history_is_pad). The LIBERO and RoboTwin evaluation scripts keep the
observation buffer. Also: one video-decoder thread per loader worker, the
CUDA cache is freed after evaluation, ZeRO-2 overlaps communication.
---
